Usage: app [flags...] <subcommand>

- Root optional value command.

Subcommands:
    pointers - Repeated optional pointer values.
    ptr      - Optional pointer parameter.
    scope    - Optional flag before positional arg.
    validate - Validated optional flag.
    help     Print this help message
    usage    Print this usage message


Flags:
    --label, -l [=OptionalLabel]   A consumer-owned three-state label.
